      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1077/100000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2be6b320a33ac51c790d37b7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ただいま戻りました！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f8b04b4edb572764b45e483a28cd1cf6e40442b258dd629e84cb2d8e5633947",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "100001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1077/100001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:512e5d2a3797b7e100dc8a86",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在思考的事情，\r\n真的很简单…\r\n就是如何回应训练员的期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2c37d2a8d1f116f33e9f83a70af2492acddcbedec3861ef8bcd0601efcc73ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1077/10001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35794b48e8295eff2f4c6c1e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一个人的力量不如两个人…\r\n这件事也许是理所当然的,但是\r\n有训练员在就有超过一百个人的力量了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ecd1ae37413ca5170a148f2803dfe692fb42dac2890299ac00e796f68624e3a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1077/10002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6710da4baaa4b26bfaea4ef4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！\r\n一起去看新年日出吧\r\n顺便还可以开始新年的第一次跑步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a16cf126d33af261fbfce3746486aacc3b73c9f3f8c90fecb8007c34a865fc4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1077/10003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30e958411cac0ded0487eeba",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是给训练员您的巧克力，\r\n都是我自己做的！\r\n觉得疲劳的时候请吃点，让自己充满活力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cbc1c2b1d0359f65da504230f4ab6c56994ff5389dc8e82ff3f3d4c0f0a00d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1077/10004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d0b785019b8b4693c1c1175",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年做的巧克力无论是做法还是材料\r\n都非常非常有讲究！\r\n感觉…应该会很好吃！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14563e5b560a68f3512a638936b1e5fa424c26f99682b57c29657f9f44ae597b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1077/10005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2877b652f79447caa758906",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "七夕啊…我的愿望是\r\n能够成为能实现大家愿望的自己…\r\n呃，总感觉有点麻烦呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea8b22edc80d03b1b4b3446bb7acd2fafd78f06b721637d7e85b57a382c2df1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1077/10006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3e3dc721e015f71ede65602",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年万圣节豁出去了！\r\n机会难得\r\n我想让大家都能带些漂亮的点心回去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecbe9ab7b20263ef452630a569b02af3caed4669692af27b399c753c260c08e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1077/10007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07f00d355bf8cfa4b8b0d5ed",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "给大家送上各自喜欢的礼物…\r\n圣诞老人这份工作还真是不错呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "908fdcf6cbbdaa7f8b8f4ade9a856adb73c67708ccaa5220bd7697e3137a05a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1077/10008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b3e63f12a50936a1689a54c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然一般来说圣诞节都是和家里人一起过\r\n但是和训练员一起过…好像\r\n也没有什么违和感！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f8b54616f089b96abdd414ec87194087fc3cd03984f0e422c29991bffd58500",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1077/10009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:965a763fcac67783225d6e03",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "干得好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "374effcca156d5c76fbf70dbcdc2ce990867ab5653ec236aced822aa0eb9a66f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "1001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1077/1001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20792f6c0c0835dae2d67320",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然很想说来年也请继续努力，\r\n…但是现在要说的是，今年一整年！\r\n真的非常非常感谢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15334c78f0f4116bd82ec49edda17274f7af01b92313bbbe81768dfdee1cff56",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1077/10010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70290ab53233084ecbf4d028",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐！\r\n为了训练员这一年能有成果\r\n我会努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a2cc874cecea9566ddcc1a5678ae5f0685b968e954f9e4c313a2aa7211167f6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1077/10011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0b1eeb14e222b10930e42a8",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…啊，那个？祝贺的文章，\r\n我想了很久…唔唔唔…\r\n总之！生日快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fced72ad2adb2a7493d491d98ffda6d36f62993305466f5319c3e8d7f5a2d237",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "10012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1077/10012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba56c2e3039bdaab6ca1e269",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想做什么来陪我庆祝生日…\r\n嗯~么…啊！那么，可以\r\n陪我一起踢足球吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f8f3cb01802113094948a86e7a1e5fb1aa5488b6735e74b151d110965076e7a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
